Clear package cache: Remove downloaded package files to free up space.

    sudo apt clean
    sudo apt autoclean

Remove old kernels: Uninstall unused kernels to free space, especially in the boot partition.
    
    sudo apt autoremove

Delete temporary files: Clear temporary files and empty the trash.

rm -rf /local/share/Trash/*

Check disk usage: Use sudo du -sh * to find large files or directories taking up space. 
